.DS_Store
/Manifest.toml
/Manifest-v*.toml
docs/build/
docs/Manifest.toml
docs/Manifest-v*.toml

# Coverage and allocation output from `Pkg.test(coverage=true)` and `--track-allocation`.
*.cov
*.mem
*.jl.*.cov

# LaTeX intermediates. Rendered documents are deliberate, committed outputs and stay
# tracked: vignettes/*/*.{html,md,pdf}, docs/src/tutorials/**, proofs/*.{md,html,pdf}.
# proofs/header.tex is a hand-written preamble, not an intermediate.
*.tex
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
!proofs/header.tex

# Lean: dependency checkout, generated documents, and `lake update` backups.
proofs/.lake/
proofs/docs/
proofs/*.bak
